{
  "slug": "claudetokensap",
  "name": "Claudetokensap",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "ClaudeTokenSAP is a Claude Code plugin marketplace focused on reducing context waste and improving session efficiency.\n\nIts first plugin, Token Optimizer, helps developers reduce token usage by preprocessing large JSON, compressing logs and search results, blocking noisy directories, preventing duplicate file reads, and preserving high-signal memory across long-running sessions.\n\nKey features include smart context clarification, JSON-to-schema compression, log summarization, token budget tracking, smart blocking, precision grep compression, and session continuity hooks.\n\nTypical workflows can see up to 70% token reduction, allowing longer Claude Code sessions with better reasoning quality.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 hooks**.\n\n- **Hooks** (7): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `Stop`, `PreCompact`, `PostCompact`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claudetokensap@claude-community` from `satyamamarpandey/ClaudeTokenSAP`.\n\nThe core idea is simple:\n\nClaudeTokenSAP is a Claude Code plugin marketplace focused on reducing context waste and improving session efficiency.\n\nIts first plugin, Token Optimizer, helps developers reduce token usage by preprocessing large JSON, compressing logs and search results, blocking noisy directories, preventing duplicate file reads, and preserving high-signal memory across long-running sessions.\n\nKey features include smart context clarification, JSON-to-schema compression, log summarization, token budget tracking, smart blocking, precision grep compression, and session continuity hooks.\n\nTypical workflows can see up to 70% token reduction, allowing longer Claude Code sessions with better reasoning quality.",
